  "summary": "Balonx Sistema is a Mexican subscription-based Phishing-as-a-Service platform that uses a persistent WebSocket channel (SCREEN_CHANGE protocol, endpoint /ws) to relay victim input to legitimate banking portals in real time and to intercept MFA/OTP codes across 14 fake screen types. It ships an Android RAT branded BankProtect (package sacred.explosion, built on the commercial Spyroid framework) distributed via the fake PROTECCION_BANCARIA security-alert screen, plus CallFlow, an AI vishing module combining GPT-4o-mini, ElevenLabs TTS and OpenAI Whisper over a FreePBX backend. Detection can key on the RAT package/class names, base64-encoded C2 configuration fields, the /ws and /balonx paths and the CallFlow domains.",
